  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It's really frustrating that especially during world hop events, I get a constant series of invite requests when I'm moving between friends+ worlds because for some reason the new 'traveling' status sees you as being in a private world and forces people to request off you, regardless of that you're moving between two completely joinable instances otherwise.  This is becoming quickly a massive inconvenience and annoyance since people have always just been able to join and worst case they're a world behind and can quickly catch up.  Please fix this.  I don't know if it's a bug or a new 'feature' but it's causing me a lot of stress.",
